{#
    The top navigation: where a reader can go from anywhere.

    Configured, or else the top level of the tree — where the footer's columns
    come from too, so a site that has said nothing still has a bar. A written
    list wins over it: which of a site's sections are its front doors is the
    one thing the tree cannot know.

    `sds-menu` and not a bare row of pills: what happens to four words when the
    header runs out of room is the element's business, measured rather than
    guessed at a breakpoint.
#}
{#- The links as data. A section entry points at its own document and a page
    at itself; an entry carrying a URL is somebody else's site and is left
    alone, the way the footer leaves one alone. -#}
{%- set links = soul.navigation.links is defined ? soul.navigation.links : [] -%}
{%- if links is empty -%}
    {%- for menu in env.projectNode.globalMenues -%}
        {%- for entry in menu.menuEntries -%}
            {%- set links = links|merge([{
                href: entry.url,
                label: entry.value.toString,
                external: '://' in entry.url,
            }]) -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- if links %}
    <sds-menu label="Sections">
        {#- A section is current when the reader is on it *or* under it — the
            rootline is the tree walked upwards, so a guideline page marks
            Guidelines. Marking only the exact page left the bar saying nothing
            on every page but five. The active pill is a filled block rather
            than a tint, one of exactly three places the accent appears. -#}
        {%- for link in links %}
            {%- set here = not link.external and link.href|trim('/') in env.currentFileRootline %}
            <a class="sds-pill{% if here %} is-active{% endif %}"
               href="{{ link.external ? link.href : renderLink(link.href) }}"
               {%- if link.external %} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"{% endif %}
               {%- if here %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>{{ link.label }}</a>
        {%- endfor %}
    </sds-menu>
{%- endif -%}
